":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-02-24T18:56:13Z","updated_at":"2026-02-25T17:31:58Z","closed_at":"2026-02-25T17:31:53Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116731","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116731","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116731.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116731.patch","merged_at":"2026-02-25T17:31:53Z"},"body":"- Required for #102378\r\n\r\nUnder rare circumstances, there'll be a scenario where one of the C builtin types that aren't bound to a fixed type tries to get cast against `Variant`. That is, one of `long` or `long long` (and their unsigned equivalents) are left out of the implicit conversion operations. While we should be moving away from implicit conversions, this should be an exception so long as the other integral types have implicit conversions. This PR achieves this with `Math::int_alt_t` and `Math::uint_alt_t`—scoped for their relative rarity—which enables `Variant` to handle these types gracefully\r\n\r\nWhile the problem this solves is meant for #102378, there's something it can apply to immediately: `version.h`. Instead of having to use a deprecated C header, or needing to find an appropriate wrapper macro for detecting if it's being parsed with rc (`RC_INVOKED` btw[^1]), we can simply exclude the include entirely! That way, we can use the more generic `unsigned long long` for the hash value, rather than `uint64_t`\r\n\r\n[^1]: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/menurc/predefined-macros","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116731/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116731/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}